{
    "_comment":  [
                     "Pinned payloads for the Doom Emacs Windows installer.",
                     "sha256 null means not yet pinned: run fetch-payloads.ps1 -Update to download and pin.",
                     "Once pinned, every normal run verifies against these hashes and fails loudly on mismatch.",
                     "publishedDigest, where present, is a hash the upstream publisher supplies out-of-band;",
                     "it is checked against our computed hash on -Update so pinning is not blind trust-on-first-use."
                 ],
