                         "id":  "emacs",
                         "description":  "GNU Emacs 31.1, UCRT64 build. NOTE: an earlier claim that this build ships libgccjit was WRONG - verified by inspecting the zip, neither GNU build contains it. UCRT64 is chosen instead for ABI consistency with the MSYS2 ucrt64 toolchain payloads below, since mixing C runtimes is a known hazard.",
